# C3 — rebuildable binaries. Findings and hashes are committed; the bytes are not.
#
# Per CLAUDE.md: record hashes and findings, not binaries. Everything ignored here is
# regenerable from the committed scripts, and the results that depend on it are already
# recorded in RESULTS.md / out_*.json:
#
#   l8/archives/   ~7.1 MB of mailing-list mbox .gz fetched by predisclosure_archives.py
#                  and cpunks_export.py. Coverage counts, term-hit counts and per-hit
#                  context are in l8/predisclosure_archives.json and l8/cpunks_export.json.
#   work/          throwaway GNUPGHOME keyrings + the C2/C3 control artifacts built fresh
#                  by every run of verify_all_signatures_rerun.py. The control outcomes are
#                  in verify_rerun.log and PGP-VERIFICATION-TABLE.json.
#   crops/         band crops, if any are ever written. Rebuildable from the committed
#                  scripts plus the render sha256s in l3/hashes.json.

l8/archives/
work/
crops/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
